  - title: LEVEL 20 | Wiring Guide
    explanation: SwitchOutput feeds L_TOP 330 and R_TOP 330. L_TOP -> MID A -> L_BOTTOM
      470 -> negative. R_TOP -> MID B -> R_BOTTOM 470 -> negative. LCD A -> MID A,
      LCD B -> MID B. Do not hard-wire the midpoints together.
    caption: PAGE 2/4 | STEP-BY-STEP CONNECTIONS
    parts:
